# d2d_run: direct-to-die / chip-co-design tier numbers

Operating point: 15 kW, 18 LPM PG25, 45 C inlet, 117 cm2 (128 W/cm2), dT_out 12.66 K
Ni 5 um electrolytic barrier R'' = 0.00063 cm2K/W; CuMo 1.0 mm face = 2.29 mm Cu-equivalent

