(dP excludes the integrated screen: add 0.4 kPa clean / 1.2 kPa at the 3x alarm.)

Deterministic synthesis values:
- CoolIT-like skived split-flow 0.2/0.2x4, 2 mm base, paste 0.07: avg 34.51, max 44.32, dP 21.80 kPa, pump 6.54 W, Qcap 12.9 kW, h_eff 101 kW/m2K
- Tier 1 PCM, engine R: avg 28.05, max 31.05, dP 5.05 kPa, pump 1.51 W, Qcap 21.5 kW, h_eff 127 kW/m2K
- Tier 2 LM on lid, engine R: avg 22.92, max 25.02, dP 5.05 kPa, pump 1.51 W, Qcap 30.3 kW, h_eff 127 kW/m2K
- Tier 3A D2D LM+Ni, engine R, base 0.8: avg 22.34, max 24.44, dP 5.05 kPa, pump 1.51 W, Qcap 31.5 kW, h_eff 127 kW/m2K
- Tier 3A D2D PCM fallback, base 0.8: avg 27.39, max 30.39, dP 5.05 kPa, pump 1.51 W, Qcap 22.2 kW, h_eff 127 kW/m2K
- Tier 3A-P D2D LM+Ni, engine P, base 0.8: avg 19.65, max 21.75, dP 5.05 kPa, pump 1.52 W, Qcap 39.8 kW, h_eff 187 kW/m2K
- Tier 3B Cu lid-core, In TIM1 0.025, face 0.8: avg 23.55, max 25.65, dP 5.05 kPa, pump 1.51 W, Qcap 29.0 kW, h_eff 127 kW/m2K

