### 4b. Die-level junction-to-inlet (die-zone sub-plate, heat-proportional zoning)

Die-zone sub-plate: footprint = logic area, Q = package - HBM, flow = 88 % of package flow; CoolIT-like: unzoned split-flow, hottest-die caloric 1.1 x dT_out (heat-map ratio 13.9/12.66).

