## 5. Rubin-Ultra-class D2D plate (fin field ~80 x 95 mm = 76 cm2, 3.6 kW)

- 1.0 LPM/kW (3.6 LPM): dP plate 1.89 kPa (+screen 0.11) (10 mm bores, comb 1.5 kPa at 4.3 LPM), u_port 0.76 m/s, case-to-inlet avg on 76 cm2 uniform 17.2 K
- 1.2 LPM/kW (4.3 LPM): dP plate 2.70 kPa (+screen 0.15) (10 mm bores, comb 1.5 kPa at 4.3 LPM), u_port 0.92 m/s, case-to-inlet avg on 76 cm2 uniform 14.8 K
- 2.4 LPM/kW (8.6 LPM): dP plate 10.63 kPa (+screen 0.61) (10 mm bores, comb 1.5 kPa at 4.3 LPM), u_port 1.83 m/s, case-to-inlet avg on 76 cm2 uniform 9.5 K
  (at 3-4 LPM the comb must be re-sized to keep branch dP >= 6x header head: hole count scaled to flow, target 1.5-2 kPa branch -> ~3 kPa plate)

